<Slide notes={`画面上有门，只解决了「看起来能过」。系统里能不能过，取决于通路配置。

做法是先按地图资料把外墙、房间分隔和物件占用标成阻挡，形成连续隔断，再用「可走」把门洞格打开。顺序不能反：先有完整隔断，再开洞，才能保证除门洞之外没有漏缝。

隔断整条封住、门洞逐格打开，这一步做完，才轮到路径检查来验证连通性。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 640, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 22 }}>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#276FBF' }}>4　　3.3.4</Text>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>画面有门，还要把门设为可走</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 4, background: '#276FBF' }} />

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.7, width: 900 }}>先形成连续隔断，再用「可走」打开门洞格；路径检查区分四种结果。</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 300, height: 64, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#276FBF' }}>连续隔断</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 64, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 300, height: 64, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#276FBF' }}>打开门洞</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 64, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 300, height: 64, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#26816B' }}>路径检查</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.3 从图像到四层空间</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>15 / 25</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
